    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Settle Islands. Rewrite the rules. Break the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/1abd740b1bfa3ab14ed01bd18d996db5.poster.avif?t=1755620371\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/1abd740b1bfa3ab14ed01bd18d996db5.webm?t=1755620371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islantiles is a cozy roguelite city-puzzler where define the way you play the game with your technologies. As you settle a chain of beautiful islands, you\u2019ll unlock, swap, and combine powerful technologies that reshape your entire strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges you to grow your small settlements into sprawling, efficient city hubs. Place buildings, gather resources, shape your deck and trigger clever card combos that chain together in satisfying ways. Technologies don\u2019t just improve your deck - they twist the core rules, changing how tiles interact, how you score and what kind of strategies you can build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new technologies or sell old ones to adapt to special challenges and pivot your strategy. Whether you\u2019re optimizing every placement or chasing ridiculous synergies, no run plays the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every island offering new puzzles, surprises and challenges, Islantiles invites you to master the art of cozy efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/4a731a1df1c24db2a183409cc5423b5b.poster.avif?t=1755620371\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/4a731a1df1c24db2a183409cc5423b5b.webp?t=1755620371\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why We Made Islantiles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love cozy games! But we felt most of them lacked the depth needed for long-term replayability. That\u2019s why we created Islantiles: A game that blends relaxation with real strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What sets Islantiles apart is its perfect balance of minimalist charm and satisfying complexity. It offers a chill, intuitive experience while rewarding clever planning, bold pivots and tactical creativity. <br>Imagine Islanders meets Balatro - a blend of accessible gameplay and endlessly rewarding combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Islantiles offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique blend of city puzzler and deck builder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and atmospheric gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth deck building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 unlockable technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 hand crafted islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscores &amp; Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless different strategies and builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite Progression</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail an island run: lose your current deck and technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep any unlocked techs permanently - and unveil new branches in your tech web.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory expands your options, so no two runs play the same.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Islantiles does NOT offer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Restrictions</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Settle Islands. Rewrite the rules. Break the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/1abd740b1bfa3ab14ed01bd18d996db5.poster.avif?t=1755620371\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/1abd740b1bfa3ab14ed01bd18d996db5.webm?t=1755620371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islantiles is a cozy roguelite city-puzzler where define the way you play the game with your technologies. As you settle a chain of beautiful islands, you\u2019ll unlock, swap, and combine powerful technologies that reshape your entire strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges you to grow your small settlements into sprawling, efficient city hubs. Place buildings, gather resources, shape your deck and trigger clever card combos that chain together in satisfying ways. Technologies don\u2019t just improve your deck - they twist the core rules, changing how tiles interact, how you score and what kind of strategies you can build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new technologies or sell old ones to adapt to special challenges and pivot your strategy. Whether you\u2019re optimizing every placement or chasing ridiculous synergies, no run plays the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every island offering new puzzles, surprises and challenges, Islantiles invites you to master the art of cozy efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/4a731a1df1c24db2a183409cc5423b5b.poster.avif?t=1755620371\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati